  "description": "Dive into State of Survival: Zombie War - now available for free download and hassle-free installation. Completely secure, no viruses or malware involved. Always enjoy the latest updates effortlessly.",
  "editor_review": "State of Survival is an exciting RPG set in a zombie apocalypse where your main goal is survival. Featuring spectacular Christmas events and a collaboration with Resident Evil, the game is filled with festive cheer and thrill. Forge alliances, construct cities, and fight against relentless zombie hordes in this engaging multiplayer RPG. Wield powerful weapons to take down zombies, train your armies, and craft effective strategies to endure. Assist fellow survivors, study the zombie virus, and unite to combat the undead. Join State of Survival and start an epic mission to save humanity in this captivating multiplayer zombie RPG!",
