    "Use an impressive range of weapons and traps to eliminate zombies.",
    "Implement your survival strategies to combat the virus and defeat the zombies.",
    "Rescue survivors who have fled from zombies to boost your power and level.",
    "Investigate the zombie virus to refine your strategies and manage the outbreak."
